# Gradle's local build cache, wherever an Android tree ends up. The narrow
# android/.gradle/ rule above didn't cover native_client/android/.gradle/ —
# that whole cache got committed by accident as a result. Anchoring on the
# bare directory name catches every Android tree, not just the one at the
# top level.
**/.gradle/
android/local.properties
android/app/phaze-release.keystore

# System
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
docs/*.md
# ...except the era notes. These are the record of what was measured off a
# real screenshot versus what's still written from memory, so they have to
# travel with the CSS they describe — without them the next person can't
# tell a sampled colour from a guessed one.
!docs/skype-era-reference.md
!docs/skype-era-research.md
!docs/skype-era-gaps.md
!docs/livekit-evaluation.md
